{"id":"8397326f1628","date":"2026-11-20","stream":"startup","section":"政府補助","title":"🏛️ 政府補助｜Celosia Therapeutics 獲 NSW Emerging Technology Commercialisation Fund $2 million","summary":"Celosia 開發針對運動神經元疾病（MND）的第二款基因療法，解決患者缺乏療法的問題。其主要候選藥物 CTx1000 針對偶發性肌萎縮側索硬化症（ALS）患者。療法設計用來幫助細胞清除有毒的 TDP-43 蛋白團塊，同時保留正常蛋白質功能。","source":"Startup Daily","feed":"Startup Daily","url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/mnd-biotech-celosia-therapeutics-bags-2-million-as-six-startups-score-nsw-govt-commercialisation-grants/","company":"Celosia Therapeutics","kind":"grant","city":"未載明","round":"未載明","amount":"$2 million","investors":["NSW government"],"program":"NSW Emerging Technology Commercialisation Fund","use_of_funds":"補助資金將用於擴展 MND 產品線，支持候選藥物開發、製造工作與臨床前研究，並配合正在患者中研究的 lead program CTx1000。","what_quote":"Celosia, which is developing a second gene therapy for motor neurone disease (MND), was the only applicant to receive the maximum grant.","use_quote":"will help us expand our MND pipeline, supporting candidate development, manufacturing work and preclinical studies alongside our lead program, CTx1000, which is currently being studied in patients with sporadic amyotrophic lateral sclerosis (ALS), the most common form of MND","announced":"2026-11-18","sources":[{"source":"Startup Daily","url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/mnd-biotech-celosia-therapeutics-bags-2-million-as-six-startups-score-nsw-govt-commercialisation-grants/"},{"source":"https://streamlinefeed.co.ke/","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPYmNieWpiT2NNVmpNaWRIUkhUeFlza01VYktCeU5WTEFEY1o0UXNSYS1ndHZSVWtoWlo5bVo3bDBib2N4amJ2eHczWExwZlBBZTZLblA4bno1LTlnZThSX1phWmFvQUx4ZlNaRmk5eGM2UHoxQ1AtZEk1eHdYTGk2NVI0UGJBZ3V2UGtQU2dFMkRqTUZxdUtFR0FuZw?oc=5"}],"timeline":[]}
{"id":"f4595c9a6ea9","date":"2026-11-20","stream":"startup","section":"新創融資","title":"🚀 新創融資｜[Hobart] Morgan AI Seed $3.65 million","summary":"Morgan AI 開發破產清算 AI 軟體，解決清算從業人員耗費大量時間整理公司帳目的問題。產品賣給破產清算事務所與從業人員。軟體會讀取銀行對帳單等紀錄，找出資產與負債、估算公司何時破產，並標記管理員可能追回款項。","source":"Startup Daily","feed":"Startup Daily","url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/colab-founders-pocket-3-65-million-seed-round-for-insolvency-fintech-named-after-their-former-administrator/","company":"Morgan AI","kind":"equity","city":"Hobart","round":"Seed","amount":"$3.65 million","investors":["Blackbird","SideStage Ventures","Archangel","TEN13","The Eights","BlackSheep","insolvency industry experts"],"program":"","use_of_funds":"資金將用於招聘、軟體開發與英國市場啟動，目標在 2027 年底前達到超過 100 家事務所。","what_quote":"The Morgan AI software reads bank statements and other records to identify assets and liabilities, estimate when a business became insolvent and flag payments an administrator might recover.","use_quote":"The funds will be used to hires, software development and a UK launch, targeting more than 100 firms by the end of 2027.","announced":"2026-11-16","sources":[{"source":"Startup Daily","url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/colab-founders-pocket-3-65-million-seed-round-for-insolvency-fintech-named-after-their-former-administrator/"},{"source":"CFOtech Australia","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOUFo0bzluRFBtMjBPUHBqQk03S1hON3BZT2lIQnhxa3U2UGMwQ05xVXBaTXBLTXdRU0tIRjdSczZLTlc2VlBseXVRY2FneWRiVHFkd2RvUGxHZTdSck1DZ1ZWdTNyMnctYjA5X0RtQ0ptZU9KT29kVkxtNXdvRjVfekxIZlNaVXZWbksybWVnQlE?oc=5"},{"source":"Business News Australia","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5"}],"timeline":[]}
{"id":"ea7998768e85","date":"2026-11-20","stream":"startup","section":"新創融資","title":"🚀 新創融資｜[Sunshine Coast] Provectus Algae Series A extension A$6.3 million","summary":"Provectus Algae 開發以藻類製成的甲烷減量飼料添加劑，解決牛隻養殖甲烷排放問題。產品賣給畜牧生產者。它用 AI 找出藻類中有用化合物，並以 Precision Photosynthesis 技術生產。","source":"Startup Daily","feed":"Startup Daily","url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/queensland-government-backs-livestock-methane-agtech-in-6-3-million-series-a-extension/","company":"Provectus Algae","kind":"equity","city":"Sunshine Coast","round":"Series A extension","amount":"A$6.3 million","investors":["At One Ventures"],"program":"","use_of_funds":"最新資金將用於擴大 Surf’N’Turf 生產，目標在 2027 年供應多達 25 萬頭牛。","what_quote":"The Noosaville biotech, founded in 2018, uses AI to identify potentially useful compounds in algae and its own Precision Photosynthesis technology to produce them.","use_quote":"The latest cash injection is to scale up production of Surf’N’Turf, to supply up to 250,000 cattle in 2027.","announced":"2026-11-15","sources":[{"source":"Startup Daily","url":"https://www.startupdaily.net/topic/funding/queensland-government-backs-livestock-methane-agtech-in-6-3-million-series-a-extension/"},{"source":"SmartCompany","url":"https://www.smartcompany.com.au/startupsmart/six-anz-startups-that-raised-525-million-this-week/"}],"timeline":[]}
